  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Off The Record** (1 review, 1 other source): Jim James plays it solo and acoustic; Reviewer singles out Jim James's acoustic version as especially worth hearing [1][2]\n- **Make It With You** (1 other source): Jim James solo covers this song by Bread [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Interview (Part 1)**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Interview (Part 2)**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Make It With You**: rare: 3 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2005-11-26.shnf** (recommended): source not stated; 4 songs; 17 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]. Said about its sound: Reviewer says the sound quality is excellent [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2005-11-26.shnf**: taped by Steven Bladt; transferred by nectardan; source: BBC Radio 2 Satellite Broadcast [1]. Also: Uploader got the recording as one large file from Steven, then normalized levels (left channel was slightly louder) and tracked it [1]",
